            <div class="col-sm-6 left-section">
                <h2>Accelerated Infrastructure for the AI Era</h2>
                <p>To meet the challenge and promise of AI, hyperscale operators are redesigning data center architectures from the ground up. Marvell silicon powers the foundations of AI: accelerated compute, connectivity, and storage infrastructure. Bringing unmatched speed and performance to any cloud, Marvell is expanding the reach of AI.</p>

                <div class="ctabutton">


	
    





 
